<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned all four auctions whereby it sought to drain liquidity, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.000 bln  7 days    25.27 pct</p>
<p>    1.000 bln  6 days    25.30 pct</p>
<p>    1.400 bln  5 days    25.41 pct</p>
<p>    1.623 bln  3 days    25.30 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
